{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/20311bb3ced8f274050a310117c02dc9.poster.avif?t=1749681475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/20311bb3ced8f274050a310117c02dc9.webm?t=1749681475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/20311bb3ced8f274050a310117c02dc9.mp4?t=1749681475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Motorbike Shop Simulator 2025</strong> \u2014 Are you ready to build your own motorcycle empire?<br>Start from scratch and grow your business from a small shop to a massive motorcycle kingdom. Buy used bikes, repair them, customize and tune them, and sell for profit.<br>Expand your workshop, build a brand-new showroom for premium models, and explore the city while managing your personal life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now is the time to build the motorcycle shop of your dreams!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/a4b735f8389642647e542782056a2ddb.poster.avif?t=1749681475\" width=800 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/a4b735f8389642647e542782056a2ddb.webm?t=1749681475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/a4b735f8389642647e542782056a2ddb.mp4?t=1749681475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfcd\ufe0f <strong>Motorcycle Buying, Selling &amp; Customization:</strong><br>Buy motorcycles in various categories, repair, tune, and personalize them with visual modifications and performance upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Workshop &amp; Shop Expansion:</strong><br>Grow your garage space and purchase new tools and equipment. Fulfill special customer orders and increase customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/8a554dd8a9fef25f56d9e933951ca3f1.avif?t=1749681475\" data-has-big width=800 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa <strong>Showroom &amp; Expo Events:</strong><br>Build a premium showroom to display brand-new motorcycles. Attend motorcycle expos and discover the latest models on the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Customer Bargaining System:</strong><br>Engage in direct negotiations with customers to get the best possible price for your bikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Theft Events:</strong><br>Protect your shop! Improve security systems to prevent thefts during the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb0 <strong>Casino:</strong><br>Try your luck or strategically invest your earnings in the city\u2019s casino venues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Cafes &amp; Social Spots:</strong><br>Visit various cafes and nightclubs in the city to network with other motorcycle enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Personal Home:</strong><br>Purchase and decorate your own house. Buy empty properties and furnish them to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Dynamic Day &amp; Night Cycle:</strong><br>Experience a living city that changes throughout the day and night with unique events and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Warehouse &amp; Garage Spaces:</strong><br>Set up large warehouse areas and de